    card title "I see mum"

A: How do you say I see mum in Russian? Let's follow Masha through her day and listen.
    draw masha masha_name v_dom

B: Я ви́жу дом.
    draw s1

A: Ви́жу means I see: I see a house, with дом just as you know it.
    highlight s1_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c

    erase s1 s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3

B: Ма́ма тут! Я ви́жу ма́му.
    draw v_mama s2

A: Did you hear it? Not ма́ма, but ма́му: the а at the end has turned into у.
    highlight s2_w_1 s2_w_5 effect underline color #8f887c

    draw lbl_mama

A: Ма́ма is mum on her own; ма́му is mum being seen, the object of ви́жу. Grammar books call it the accusative; we'll call it the object ending.
    highlight lbl_mama part у$ effect pulse color #3f7d4e

    erase s2 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4 s2_g_5

B: И ко́шка! Я ви́жу ко́шку.
    draw v_koshka s3

    draw lbl_koshka

A: Ко́шка is new: a cat who is a she. It ends in а too, so seen, it's ко́шку.
    highlight lbl_koshka part у$ effect pulse color #3f7d4e

    draw lbl_dom

A: But дом stayed дом: only an а or a я at the end changes, а to у and я to ю; words that end like он or оно́ stay as they are.
    highlight lbl_dom effect underline color #8f887c

    erase s3 s3_g_1 s3_g_2 s3_g_3 s3_g_4 s3_g_5 v_dom v_mama v_koshka lbl_dom lbl_mama lbl_koshka

B: Я чита́ю кни́гу.
    draw v_kniga s4

    draw lbl_kniga

A: Чита́ю means I read, with the ю of говорю́; and кни́га takes the object ending: кни́гу.
    highlight s4_w_2 lbl_kniga effect underline color #8f887c

    erase s4 s4_g_1 s4_g_2 s4_g_3

B: Я пью во́ду и молоко́.
    draw v_voda v_moloko s5

A: Пью is I drink, the я form of пьёт from the story.
    highlight s5_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c

    draw lbl_voda lbl_moloko

A: Вода́ becomes во́ду, and the stress jumps to the front; but молоко́, an оно́ word, stays.
    highlight lbl_voda lbl_moloko effect underline color #8f887c

    erase s5 s5_g_1 s5_g_2 s5_g_3 s5_g_4 s5_g_5 v_kniga v_voda v_moloko lbl_kniga lbl_voda lbl_moloko

    draw tom tom_name sis parallel true

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw verbs

A: Ви́дишь is you see, with the ишь of говори́шь; only the я form has the ж: ви́жу.
    highlight verbs part ви́дишь effect underline color #8f887c

    draw my_pair

A: And my changes with its noun: моя́ сестра́, but мою́ сестру́. There's я becoming ю, the twin of у.
    highlight my_pair part мою́ effect pulse color #3f7d4e

    erase talk verbs my_pair sis

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: So after ви́жу, чита́ю and пью: а becomes у, я becomes ю, and the other words stay as they are.
    draw h_ch h_st b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 k1 k2 k3 k4 k5

    draw warn

A: One warning: people and animals that are he and end in a consonant, like брат and кот, change in another way; that's for a later lesson.
    highlight warn effect underline color #8f887c

    hide board warn

    draw sort

    ask "After ви́жу, does the word change? Put each one where it belongs." on sort store s stage own voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: {s} right on the first try: the а words change, the rest stay.
        wrong: {s} of {s.total} on the first try: only the words ending in а change.

    erase sort

    draw q_sis

    quiz "Masha sees her sister. Я ви́жу ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "ви́жу сестру́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Сестру́: after ви́жу, the а of сестра́ becomes у.
        wrong: Сестре́ is the ending after в and на; after ви́жу, а becomes у.
        * сестра́
        + сестру́
        * сестре́

    erase q_sis reveal_1_stamp

    draw q_water

    ask "Masha drinks water. Type the missing word: Я пью ___." answer ["воду"] reveal.text "пью во́ду" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Во́ду: вода́ swaps its а for у, and the stress moves to the front.
        wrong: Start from вода́; what happens to its last letter?

    erase q_water reveal_2_stamp

    draw q_book

    ask "Type I read in Russian: Я ___ кни́гу." answer ["читаю"] reveal.text "я чита́ю кни́гу" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Чита́ю: I read, ending in ю, like говорю́.
        wrong: It starts with Ч and ends like говорю́.

    erase q_book reveal_3_stamp

    draw q_cat

    quiz "Masha sees her cat. Я ви́жу ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "ви́жу ко́шку" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ко́шку: seen, the а of ко́шка becomes у.
        wrong: Is the cat on her own here, or being seen?
        * ко́шка
        + ко́шку
        * ко́шке

    erase q_cat reveal_4_stamp

    group recap members ["r1","r2","r3","r4"]
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap

    show board

A: So one letter tells you who is seen: ма́ма is mum herself, and ма́му is mum in Masha's eyes.
    highlight b1 part у$ effect pulse color #3f7d4e

    hide board

A: And at the café you can now ask for water, too: во́ду, пожа́луйста! Пока́!
    icon end_cafe size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["droplet","cup with straw"] icon_look picture of "glass of water"
    text end_say "Во́ду, пожа́луйста!" say "Во́ду, пожа́луйста!" colors {"у$":"#3f7d4e"} x 500 y 290 font_size 64

